# For Alicia, Original Piano Composition

A piece I wrote for my then-new girlfriend, now wife, Alicia, in 2019. Played on a Yamaha NU-1 “hybrid” piano. Something toward a Romantic/Impressionist piece.

=> /pub/For-Alicia.ogg For Alicia.ogg

I believe that, when I composed it, I had written at least most of it out as sheet music, by hand. They’re long lost, now. I’ve lost the piece in my fingers, too—only this recording remains. I’ll have to transcribe from the recording so I can relearn it again.

